{"chapters":[{"title":"Try every jump recursively","code":"def can_jump(nums):\n    def go(i):\n        if i >= len(nums) - 1:\n            return True\n        return any(go(i + k) for k in range(nums[i], 0, -1))\n    return go(0)","frames":[{"caption":"<strong>Try every jump recursively</strong> &mdash; O(2<sup>n</sup>) time, O(n) extra space. Input: <code>can_jump(nums=[2, 3, 1, 1, 4])</code>. Step through to watch the code work on this input.","line":1,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"nums","label":"nums","v":["2","3","1","1","4"],"cls":["","","","",""]}],"vars":[],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>def go(i):</code>","line":2,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"nums","label":"nums","v":["2","3","1","1","4"],"cls":["","","","",""]}],"vars":[],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>return go(0)</code> &mdash; calls <code>go(i=0)</code>","line":6,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"nums","label":"nums","v":["2","3","1","1","4"],"cls":["src","","","",""],"ptr":{"0":["i"]}}],"vars":[["i","0",1]],"stack":["can_jump(nums)","go(i=0)"]},{"caption":"<code>if i &gt;= len(nums) - 1:</code> &rarr; <strong>false</strong> (i = 0)","line":3,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"nums","label":"nums","v":["2","3","1","1","4"],"cls":["src","","","",""],"ptr":{"0":["i"]}}],"vars":[["i","0",0]],"stack":["can_jump(nums)","go(i=0)"]},{"caption":"<code>return any(go(i + k) for k in range(nums[i], 0, -1))</code> &mdash; calls <code>&lt;genexpr&gt;()</code>","line":5,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"nums","label":"nums","v":["2","3","1","1","4"],"cls":["src","","","",""],"ptr":{"0":["i"]}}],"vars":[["i","0",0]],"stack":["can_jump(nums)","go(i=0)","<genexpr>()"]},{"caption":"<code>return any(go(i + k) for k in range(nums[i], 0, -1))</code> &mdash; calls <code>go(i=2)</code>","line":5,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"nums","label":"nums","v":["2","3","1","1","4"],"cls":["","","src","",""],"ptr":{"2":["i"]}}],"vars":[["i","2",1],["k","2",1]],"stack":["can_jump(nums)","go(i=0)","<genexpr>()","go(i=2)"]},{"caption":"<code>if i &gt;= len(nums) - 1:</co